OL,3,AHolborn and St Pancras by-election gets
OL,4,Aunder way
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoting is under way in the Holborn and
OL,7,FSt Pancras by-election as candidates
OL,8,Ffrom across the political spectrum vie
OL,9,Fto become its new MP.
OL,11,FAbout 30 polling stations - at churches
OL,12,Fand community centres - in the north
OL,13,FLondon constituency opened at 07:00 BST
OL,14,Fand will close at 22:00, when a count
OL,15,Fwill begin.
OL,17,FThe seat became vacant after former
OL,18,Fprime minister Sir Keir Starmer
OL,19,Fannounced he was standing down to focus
OL,20,Fon a role in international affairs.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
